MVT for Mac
https://github.com/2B-4G10/MVT-GUI

This repository contains:

- MVT, the Mobile Verification Toolkit (src/ and tests/), by The MVT
  Authors (https://github.com/mvt-project/mvt).
- MVT for Mac (macos/), a macOS app that runs MVT.
- MVT for Windows (windows/), a Windows app that runs MVT.

  This Source Code Form is subject to the terms of the MVT License,
  v. 1.1. If a copy of the MVT License was not distributed with this
  file, You can obtain one at https://license.mvt.re/1.1/.

All three are covered by the MVT License 1.1 in the LICENSE file. The license
only allows analysing a device with the consent of its owner or user.
The source code of every release is available at the address above.

The Windows app's download also contains Python (Python Software
Foundation License, in Lib\PYTHON-LICENSE.txt), Qt and PySide6 (GNU LGPL
v3; their licenses are in Lib\site-packages) and the Python packages MVT
uses, each under its own license, which is in its folder in
Lib\site-packages. Their source code is available from python.org,
qt.io and pypi.org.

